          "title": "INSTALL NEW PAD SUPPORT PLATE, NEW PAD GUIDE PLATES AND NEW ANTI-RATTLE SPRINGS",
          "text": "INSTALL NEW PAD SUPPORT PLATE, NEW PAD GUIDE PLATES AND NEW ANTI-RATTLE SPRINGS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "number": "7",
          "title": "PUSH PISTON INTO CYLINDER",
